<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8" ?>
<CustomMetadata
  xmlns="http://soap.sforce.com/2006/04/metadata"
  xmlns:xsi="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema-instance"
  xmlns:xsd="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema"
>
    <label>Flows - After-save update of same record</label>
    <protected>true</protected>
    <values>
        <field>Domain__c</field>
        <value xsi:type="xsd:string">Flow</value>
    </values>
    <values>
        <field>IsEnabled__c</field>
        <value xsi:type="xsd:boolean">true</value>
    </values>
    <values>
        <field>Severity__c</field>
        <value xsi:type="xsd:string">Medium</value>
    </values>
    <values>
        <field>Category__c</field>
        <value xsi:type="xsd:string">Performance</value>
    </values>
    <values>
        <field>Confidence__c</field>
        <value xsi:type="xsd:string">High</value>
    </values>
    <values>
        <field>Threshold__c</field>
        <value xsi:nil="true" />
    </values>
    <values>
        <field>Description__c</field>
        <value
      xsi:type="xsd:string"
    >An after-save record-triggered flow updates the record that triggered it.</value>
    </values>
    <values>
        <field>Rationale__c</field>
        <value
      xsi:type="xsd:string"
    >The update saves the record a second time: triggers, validation rules and flows run again. A before-save flow sets the same fields up to 10 times faster without an extra save.</value>
    </values>
    <values>
        <field>SuggestedAction__c</field>
        <value
      xsi:type="xsd:string"
    >Move the field updates of the triggering record to a before-save (Fast Field Updates) flow; keep the after-save flow for related records and actions.</value>
    </values>
</CustomMetadata>
